# Calibration photos, generated plates, and results are intentionally tracked
# for research provenance and reproducibility.
# Sony P06-D 16-bit analysis PNGs are deterministic local derivatives of the
# hash-pinned ARW inputs and exceed GitHub's per-file size limit.
docs/research/photos/sony-a7m4/p06-d/*.png

# RANDMIX5 16-bit Sony analysis PNGs exceed GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.
# Only the *-8bit.png derivatives are tracked; recover 16-bit originals from
# Dropbox version history or regenerate from ARW if needed locally.
docs/research/photos/sony-a7m4/randmix5/randmix5-b.png
docs/research/photos/sony-a7m4/randmix5/randmix5-w.png
docs/research/photos/sony-a7m4/randmix5/randmix5-bw-split-colorchecker.png
docs/research/photos/sony-a7m4/randmix5-x3/randmix5-b.png
docs/research/photos/sony-a7m4/randmix5-x3/randmix5-w.png
docs/research/photos/sony-a7m4/randmix5-x3/randmix5-bw-split-colorchecker.png

